    <constraints /></selectionEntry>
    </selectionEntries><rules><rule id="r41-unit-xvi-12-xvi-horus-lupercal-the-warmaster-r32-retinue-rule" name="Primarch Retinue" hidden="false"><description>Horus may select a Legion Honour Guard Squad, Legion Terminator Command Squad or Justaerin Terminator Squad as his Primarch Retinue. The Justaerin option is selectable here; Honour Guard and Terminator Command use their normal Primarch Retinue entries where present in the catalogue.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups></selectionEntry>
