              <rule id="r41-unit-xvi-13-xvi-horus-ascended-the-warmaster-r32-ret-just-r41-unit-xvi-0-justaerin-terminator-squad-opt-9-banestrike-ammunition-r32-rule" name="Banestrike Ammunition" hidden="false"><description>Purchase for every eligible Justaerin model at +2 points per eligible model. Banestrike is used with Foeblaster/Combi weapons; a natural To Wound roll of 6 is resolved at AP3. Models that replace the bolt weapon with a pair of Lightning Claws or a Heavy weapon neither pay for nor benefit from Banestrike.</description></rule></rules>
